大致分三层，方法按控制领域收口，不按 SDK service 原样映射。

```text
core_device_transport
  Dart: DeviceTransportRuntime
  Native: NativeSessionRegistry / Lease SPI

core_device_control
  Dart: DeviceControlClient + DTO + Provider
  Private: Pigeon
  Native: AKW/BK ControlAdapter

Feature
  只依赖 DeviceControlClient
```

`core_device_control` 的 Dart 公开结构：

```dart
/// 设备控制能力客户端。
abstract interface class DeviceControlClient {
  Future<Result<void>> setVolume(
    DeviceControlTarget target,
    int volume,
  );

  Future<Result<void>> setVoiceWakeup(
    DeviceControlTarget target,
    bool enabled,
  );

  Future<Result<void>> setRecordDuration(
    DeviceControlTarget target,
    DeviceRecordKind kind,
    int seconds,
  );

  Future<Result<void>> setVideoDirection(
    DeviceControlTarget target,
    DeviceVideoDirection direction,
  );

  Future<Result<void>> setWearDetection(
    DeviceControlTarget target,
    bool enabled,
  );

  Future<Result<bool>> wearDetectionState(DeviceControlTarget target);

  Stream<DeviceWifiScanEvent> scanWifi(
    DeviceControlTarget target, {
    required Duration timeout,
  });

  Future<Result<void>> connectWifi(
    DeviceControlTarget target,
    DeviceWifiCredential credential,
  );

  Future<Result<void>> deleteWifi(
    DeviceControlTarget target,
    DeviceWifiCredential credential,
  );

  Future<Result<DeviceWifiState>> wifiConnectionState(
    DeviceControlTarget target,
  );

  Future<void> dispose();
}
```

其中 DTO 只表达业务语义：

```dart
class DeviceControlTarget {
  const DeviceControlTarget({required this.deviceId});
  final String deviceId;
}

enum DeviceRecordKind { video, audio }
enum DeviceVideoDirection { landscape, portrait }

class DeviceWifiCredential {
  const DeviceWifiCredential({required this.ssid, this.password});
  final String ssid;
  final String? password;
}
```

Pigeon 只传私有 bridge DTO，例如 `ControlTargetMessage`、`WifiCredentialMessage`、`WifiScanEventMessage`；不会出现 `WeikeDeviceSession`、`AkGlassesSettingsService` 或 SDK 枚举。

原生插件内部结构是：

```kotlin
private suspend fun setVolume(deviceId: String, volume: Int) {
  val lease = DeviceTransportNativeSessionRegistry.acquireLease(deviceId)

  lease.withSession { session ->
    when (val adapter = controlAdapterFor(session)) {
      is AkwControlAdapter -> adapter.setVolume(volume)
      is BkControlAdapter -> adapter.setVolume(volume)
    }
  }
}
```

`controlAdapterFor(session)` 只在 native 内部按设备类别选择 AKW/BK adapter。每次调用前校验 lease；断连、目标不一致或 engine detach 时直接失败或结束流，不会切换 raw 协议、更不会新建 BLE 连接。

文件组织建议如下：

```text
core_device_control/
  lib/src/model/
    device_control_target.dart
    device_wifi_state.dart
    device_wifi_scan_event.dart
    device_control_enums.dart
  lib/src/service/
    device_control_client.dart
  lib/src/provider/
    device_control_providers.dart
  lib/src/impl/
    pigeon_device_control_client.dart
  pigeons/
    device_control_bridge.dart
  android/.../
    CoreDeviceControlPlugin.kt
    AkwDeviceControlAdapter.kt
    BkDeviceControlAdapter.kt
  ios/.../
    CoreDeviceControlPlugin.swift
    AkwDeviceControlAdapter.swift
    BkDeviceControlAdapter.swift
```

这样上层永远面对同一套 `DeviceControlClient`，而 SDK 升级、AKW/BK 差异、Pigeon 和 session 复用都被限制在 `core_device_control` 的原生实现里。
